  "notes": "Corrects VL53 identity failure classification: ambiguous register-pointer NACKs receive one address-only confirmation, while responding devices use the existing bounded functional-failure budget. Removes redundant identity-related shared-bus invalidations and retains a fixed 16-byte last-failure record for explicit USB diagnostics. All 30 focused host suites and the normal PlatformIO build passed; USB installation, normal startup, connected Twin Button, and unchanged 64-row flashlight learning data were verified. Two five-minute passive captures preserved responsive CRT sampling and exposed distinct zero-byte identity/ranging reads. Primary IR absence and intermittent CRT read failures remain unresolved; this release does not claim an electrical repair.",
